{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "ab83fd9868f5f4ce2b0de2408f974b13dbd67fa2e3106c2475dcef375434c1cd",
  "bundle_request_count": 20,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:1ad0e132fab677d58bad1b646a3c8097e2d765a69c0c52f4db412df7f89ea934",
      "request_id": "1ad0e132fab677d58bad1b646a3c8097e2d765a69c0c52f4db412df7f89ea934",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b04b0f11ff62ab787f30663c33e5f631",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年的法网资格赛之后，刘婧文暂停了比赛，把时间留给心理健康。那年九月，她在自己的博客里写下这件事。她原本还想继续打、继续试，但教练和运动心理学家的建议，让她开始认真考虑休息。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fc5d2f0cffbea8bdcd2f2d9d09d1ceb3e352518714689c57aeb4d64a9779632c",
      "words_sha256": "9a461106ac2754764bfa7e8d3024efeb09cf47f931cc1473a0f55c334780ec1f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1de5486c92c9e8446ffd969a9582418677c854916a74dbfb5b8ef54284bcc878",
      "request_id": "1de5486c92c9e8446ffd969a9582418677c854916a74dbfb5b8ef54284bcc878",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ded0b0f8de08fe90cf18a962c37160c2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她出生在美国加州的千橡市，五岁时，开始跟随当地大学的网球教练练球。十四岁，她就拿到了第一座ITF职业赛单打冠军。网球很早就成了她的生活。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "99bb95c7b49a3982ca553edf662c8208980a85a3d42bde893a0c4cccab17217e",
      "words_sha256": "c71fdc63a13081be4583404c059d08aa41f0782e35fd3e7710f7e0a6cede15bf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2e7a5fee3af4cfdfb437812adcb85c0cc3eea1f825ad2f4b442bd4a1c391bceb",
      "request_id": "2e7a5fee3af4cfdfb437812adcb85c0cc3eea1f825ad2f4b442bd4a1c391bceb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e25cdb411d2e8f10e5077e8309655a69",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛面对舒布拉泽，首盘打到五平，她随后连赢两局。第二盘六比四，时隔四年，她又一次打进巡回赛单打决赛。从二十一岁时的拉巴特，到二十六岁时的香港，终于有了第二次机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ed4cd10eae599202d8d8f05cb1c73854edc5cf8322fd03be9daa4031c165c5e7",
      "words_sha256": "78fd9941ebf487fb0e02814e493c7004ef5b28afcbce9f00f0cf11390991c814"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2ed352057fcfe5206f11e5bff1b7af1af3c6bd21b4f82d82b4352cdeb06c1db6",
      "request_id": "2ed352057fcfe5206f11e5bff1b7af1af3c6bd21b4f82d82b4352cdeb06c1db6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d00c0eaf0a70975a203c9fb09b2d3ba1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二一年，她第一次进入单打世界前一百。第二年，她先在巴黎拿到WTA一百二十五级别冠军，又在拉巴特，第一次打进巡回赛单打决赛。可是决赛面对特雷维桑，她只拿到三局。奖杯，还要继续等。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "391db690a74c50d7bbe4ba59f08ce029322ef12e13e0de8d6a1cf7cf6f9b0582",
      "words_sha256": "4d0c873bc3d2aa3642789b5f631fd81316badeac87fc8d02a23fab5fd61718f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3b86f83ea5c314835b0d2eb47d40ea4cc83b9bf2676e0667326ede3e6d50c5fd",
      "request_id": "3b86f83ea5c314835b0d2eb47d40ea4cc83b9bf2676e0667326ede3e6d50c5fd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7a68247b81bd3b6c8895c0bd338ee504",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九年前，她在这里拿过同年龄组冠军；九年后，第一次站上成年组第三轮。她说，年轻时的自己，反而会比现在更相信这件事。她仍在学习把信心找回来，也学着接受：比赛的结果，无法完全由自己控制。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9fa9e7f93bed4ec294f370ddb0699f787432d84687e20907bd960839db2a3e7e",
      "words_sha256": "e7a52ee8d90ac5cccd310f85026e18ca357ca6b6bf01a6836882762d06c6f617"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3ee23b2757b21f5a42045aa336b327bb0e086c4a390ca29014c1d04c2bb4184f",
      "request_id": "3ee23b2757b21f5a42045aa336b327bb0e086c4a390ca29014c1d04c2bb4184f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1e6a294f36d935fdcecddc8929ea52c8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二三年一月，她的单打排名最高来到世界第五十二位。这个数字背后，也有她后来公开讲过的另一面：原以为进入前一百，就会觉得自己已经做到了；真正走到那里，赛前的紧张与眼泪，却没有自动消失。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c03d52c3702df2644a621827526dff66ed966efbdeefd78758ef6b6e62f8b3c1",
      "words_sha256": "259068b2a49e225c6933a6c8526d59d507277469775ead74b53792a741100496"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5fb1709fa9e0e01f1b675303c08582d75a3088307f051b9dacaf01082fa06af1",
      "request_id": "5fb1709fa9e0e01f1b675303c08582d75a3088307f051b9dacaf01082fa06af1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bcb6e07204f0f1b1b77991fc814e9ebe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "重返赛场，也有新的难关。二零二五年，她与合作多年的教练分开，排名一度跌出世界前四百。后来，她开始和克莱门斯·瓦格纳合作。到秋天的广州，当时排名三百零五的她，从资格赛打到了四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0929fb0c0038a4edb7a3bf4c7aea5f4ba2504c002908859627750763db18721a",
      "words_sha256": "9ef6912492f14367972be5a4ae0e26e48e85864c01faccc280b26d77f25247a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:635835172367d28b8c82866ae2a729eb9c072a6a7b37604c38e2b572f782f4d6",
      "request_id": "635835172367d28b8c82866ae2a729eb9c072a6a7b37604c38e2b572f782f4d6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5362f9244d7dc99f23c260fbd86e389f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "刘婧文等到二十六岁，巡回赛单打首冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c3e7caca2816a25910b0a1d05b559d9b5da06f8af410e7cdc05415fbcc6c83f1",
      "words_sha256": "6085c13b02265161d89b0c44fd5e52fe5cff97947c07a9a3b17f828a9eb35620"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:681e66c3b4421bca37741f1d22d803b7b702a294cb9d8262be4bc3a26722d05e",
      "request_id": "681e66c3b4421bca37741f1d22d803b7b702a294cb9d8262be4bc3a26722d05e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3761002a05a9028426396e8d37c9c0e7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘五比零，刘婧文发球，四十比三十。这一次，距离巡回赛单打冠军，只差最后一分。十七岁赢温网的那个女孩，如今站在这里，二十六岁，准备再发一个球。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fac9c220fc646f77cc1f199874c560ca751154bb945e3b876331408b7f010969",
      "words_sha256": "478c76a74c883b119d545ad67b6e2539325b488fee91e55480e48803ccc92ef7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:74d97ab4695bbed46a7a0a214a5ca4ee358697dd8ac0c04d59ed620f0d2f529a",
      "request_id": "74d97ab4695bbed46a7a0a214a5ca4ee358697dd8ac0c04d59ed620f0d2f529a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cf3f2f5011bdac8312782dfeb88da47b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她也在写作。每天记日记，把赛前的焦虑和脑子里的想法一点点整理出来。她把自己的名字，和英文里清晰这个词，拼成了博客的标题。球场之外，她在学习怎样更好地理解自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c9017bd739d04c788eff1f66d14b7a7fb6e372853de2740fd0db8d760f6119f5",
      "words_sha256": "f8f578f9ae814c95f5921624d5333e1eeb1f9b75dcdb5c311bef61c19b303bc7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:752be66dcd08d6cf1e49bcd946d4b080fe95de13cb5c1a5a6d777a5bb07bf65b",
      "request_id": "752be66dcd08d6cf1e49bcd946d4b080fe95de13cb5c1a5a6d777a5bb07bf65b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "721c1cbaaedde8676e84a530be8ced02",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十七岁那年，她先拿到法网同年龄组的女单亚军，又在温网走到决赛。这一次，对面是同样来自美国的安·李。打到决胜盘，她终于赢了下来。这是二十五年来，美国球员第一次拿到这个组别的温网女单冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9a1aae18a0839d0b1e9fe786598e8f11adeb8a4865b1efe99fa61bd5a9f7972c",
      "words_sha256": "d7cc9eee881f13a6dfda98692c93334d772e2ea4f5e936327b8a2bd146450378"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:79acd78b9800164931d632a5b28b63d31cb78f4eb7118bb5ea5dfe0f5a57d24d",
      "request_id": "79acd78b9800164931d632a5b28b63d31cb78f4eb7118bb5ea5dfe0f5a57d24d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bbdcc85609ea7f8c8d3c3b1601b20353",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛的对手，是世界排名第十七的伊埃拉。首盘三比四落后时，伊埃拉叫了医疗暂停。比赛继续，她也坚持打到了最后。刘婧文拿下首盘六比三，第二盘又建立起领先。这一次，她要把自己的节奏，保持到比赛结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0002db186848b2092e864d8d6f3f48f6c03eb74907eff8bdda0da79479ff9181",
      "words_sha256": "ae5b1dc4f194a317fac7201bf7210c5e7495d9702b21b45345571ff0799f6f1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7f0668da52e86fd243db0e74a6506baeb2a538ae8bd57d135b14326e985d476e",
      "request_id": "7f0668da52e86fd243db0e74a6506baeb2a538ae8bd57d135b14326e985d476e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "02e044207a1a53b61029046f025050cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "登顶同年龄组的世界第一，并没有替她打开成年赛场的每一道门。同年的美网，她从资格赛连赢三场进入正赛，首轮输给了段莹莹。此后几年，她仍要在资格赛和低级别职业赛之间，争取自己的位置。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "77e07f59b7f3fd4584644de9c8374394fafcf6cd4cae79e0d114f504e364d783",
      "words_sha256": "d21a99ce8794c6ac49a113a3aa1e8357aa45d248ace72f55154ba359cdf82a8a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8f23844dec391f4f994217db71d5f1c81afe209fb8f565dff70d86c9aacc063f",
      "request_id": "8f23844dec391f4f994217db71d5f1c81afe209fb8f565dff70d86c9aacc063f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1608fc4fd9f8e425ef3a3efeb8e508e2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年五月，在斯洛伐克的特尔纳瓦，她拿到两年来第一座单打冠军。那是一站ITF赛事。随后来到法网，她又从资格赛打起，走进正赛。排名、胜场、信心，都在一点点重新积累。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6b2b33b335a1e53b423b65c6108423ffe5aafa94361030ba2198cfd65b15130e",
      "words_sha256": "e0624190684a19653e086cebe7f9c76ac6419ace60c146c3a96258ffddc75470"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9a05e7d7303729ae8bcfb4e0e6b2f596de2ebcc5ee924ebbd266710515b833e4",
      "request_id": "9a05e7d7303729ae8bcfb4e0e6b2f596de2ebcc5ee924ebbd266710515b833e4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c4e3a2361217f4db3efe667295b07d58",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月，她又在巴兰基亚拿到一座WTA一百二十五级别冠军。所以，香港这次，准确地说，是巡回赛单打首冠。她已经拿过不少奖杯，这一座，却有不同的分量。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cf4160538e91279f45026a362f28192e68d561c8eb6df955d174d05e482e3d4a",
      "words_sha256": "592bc28634cd74b0c86e3f6e62dd7b0b3756aaf7664a75d36bee74edec02d871"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b130200c97ac07e19a08fefa00b999c5c0c808d7ddecb7591eae2c6f5a94da48",
      "request_id": "b130200c97ac07e19a08fefa00b999c5c0c808d7ddecb7591eae2c6f5a94da48",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "010d76416df44bb6568a0a0c1123e2fa",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五场胜利，一盘未失。刘婧文终于拿到巡回赛单打首冠。那个十七岁在温网赢球的女孩，经历过暂停，也经历过重新出发。今天，她亲吻了这只奖杯。这个故事里，你更佩服夺冠的那一分，还是那些把自己带回球场的日子？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a6b6a528a98e1e244ec4f969a9f583e26c64b5deb41415ca5c11490b091073cd",
      "words_sha256": "dfdb1139f2e01e33ed42a03b104cf1018163022a34da8a2a795499711465f7c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d01422f286e7af5fcb3cad995867c7b55dc5ee16f6c86f3e3b83990789fd5f97",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dbe0f9bbd9651078caf5698220fe85a18adbaa66ccf4efa921ed5882c92aa92a",
      "request_id": "dbe0f9bbd9651078caf5698220fe85a18adbaa66ccf4efa921ed5882c92aa92a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "375c9d705376a4c0fc4fdf6721198328",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了温网，她连过资格赛，再打进生涯第一次大满贯第三轮。那天早上，她的酒店住宿到期，只能先退房；赢球后，又得重新找住处。男友提醒她：收拾行李，并不代表你就要离开比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "eafb285c24d530ba034db91a1c7a541124034a6ea7895e2e60905fca1e688d7b",
      "words_sha256": "7542160cf9fbc84b110a70a690f6c49caed08a5cd9e7d7c99091139f321bea49"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f1e722a1053ef847fe095554e81d552d6d36abdcb2047f2668cbdab095e71c8f",
      "request_id": "f1e722a1053ef847fe095554e81d552d6d36abdcb2047f2668cbdab095e71c8f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d1684a60ae35312b3c8f5d1097db8a7a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "香港的这座奖杯，刘婧文等到了二十六岁。九年前，她已经在温网的十八岁及以下组夺冠，还登上了这个组别的世界第一。可从那座草地球场，走到巡回赛单打首冠，中间还有一段很长的路。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "463fa7befc5237913155e2b53b0876bc5a29e5272ba00115247969950971b0e3",
      "words_sha256": "42ffc9c02ad63abd53faa5f13abbdbe0468283aca93ebb1cfc6a2d51ed8621f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ffacc2a899cd38484ee94255df218cbe1b02bc58b267555255ac964ec5ce0f3a",
      "request_id": "ffacc2a899cd38484ee94255df218cbe1b02bc58b267555255ac964ec5ce0f3a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1bd460db02b56b2fc1b63c147a10af0d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一周前的广州，她止步八强。来到香港时，她的世界排名是一百零二。首轮击败普罗佐罗娃，第二轮战胜博尔特，再过森梅兹这一关。来到赛季末的这一站，她把胜利一场接一场留了下来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ca71a009c63b40ff4fc5af990862f982c11731c1843697d12ea923c773162308",
      "words_sha256": "43eba6d4f078503301c2269f627a32c142678c8e56afc6019988b59c1df1763a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "463fa7befc5237913155e2b53b0876bc5a29e5272ba00115247969950971b0e3",
      "words_sha256": "42ffc9c02ad63abd53faa5f13abbdbe0468283aca93ebb1cfc6a2d51ed8621f7",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d1684a60ae35312b3c8f5d1097db8a7a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "香港的这座奖杯，刘婧文等到了二十六岁。九年前，她已经在温网的十八岁及以下组夺冠，还登上了这个组别的世界第一。可从那座草地球场，走到巡回赛单打首冠，中间还有一段很长的路。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "99bb95c7b49a3982ca553edf662c8208980a85a3d42bde893a0c4cccab17217e",
      "words_sha256": "c71fdc63a13081be4583404c059d08aa41f0782e35fd3e7710f7e0a6cede15bf",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ded0b0f8de08fe90cf18a962c37160c2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她出生在美国加州的千橡市，五岁时，开始跟随当地大学的网球教练练球。十四岁，她就拿到了第一座ITF职业赛单打冠军。网球很早就成了她的生活。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9a1aae18a0839d0b1e9fe786598e8f11adeb8a4865b1efe99fa61bd5a9f7972c",
      "words_sha256": "d7cc9eee881f13a6dfda98692c93334d772e2ea4f5e936327b8a2bd146450378",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "721c1cbaaedde8676e84a530be8ced02",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十七岁那年，她先拿到法网同年龄组的女单亚军，又在温网走到决赛。这一次，对面是同样来自美国的安·李。打到决胜盘，她终于赢了下来。这是二十五年来，美国球员第一次拿到这个组别的温网女单冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "77e07f59b7f3fd4584644de9c8374394fafcf6cd4cae79e0d114f504e364d783",
      "words_sha256": "d21a99ce8794c6ac49a113a3aa1e8357aa45d248ace72f55154ba359cdf82a8a",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "02e044207a1a53b61029046f025050cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "登顶同年龄组的世界第一，并没有替她打开成年赛场的每一道门。同年的美网，她从资格赛连赢三场进入正赛，首轮输给了段莹莹。此后几年，她仍要在资格赛和低级别职业赛之间，争取自己的位置。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "391db690a74c50d7bbe4ba59f08ce029322ef12e13e0de8d6a1cf7cf6f9b0582",
      "words_sha256": "4d0c873bc3d2aa3642789b5f631fd81316badeac87fc8d02a23fab5fd61718f3",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d00c0eaf0a70975a203c9fb09b2d3ba1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二一年，她第一次进入单打世界前一百。第二年，她先在巴黎拿到WTA一百二十五级别冠军，又在拉巴特，第一次打进巡回赛单打决赛。可是决赛面对特雷维桑，她只拿到三局。奖杯，还要继续等。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c03d52c3702df2644a621827526dff66ed966efbdeefd78758ef6b6e62f8b3c1",
      "words_sha256": "259068b2a49e225c6933a6c8526d59d507277469775ead74b53792a741100496",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1e6a294f36d935fdcecddc8929ea52c8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二三年一月，她的单打排名最高来到世界第五十二位。这个数字背后，也有她后来公开讲过的另一面：原以为进入前一百，就会觉得自己已经做到了；真正走到那里，赛前的紧张与眼泪，却没有自动消失。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fc5d2f0cffbea8bdcd2f2d9d09d1ceb3e352518714689c57aeb4d64a9779632c",
      "words_sha256": "9a461106ac2754764bfa7e8d3024efeb09cf47f931cc1473a0f55c334780ec1f",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b04b0f11ff62ab787f30663c33e5f631",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年的法网资格赛之后，刘婧文暂停了比赛，把时间留给心理健康。那年九月，她在自己的博客里写下这件事。她原本还想继续打、继续试，但教练和运动心理学家的建议，让她开始认真考虑休息。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0929fb0c0038a4edb7a3bf4c7aea5f4ba2504c002908859627750763db18721a",
      "words_sha256": "9ef6912492f14367972be5a4ae0e26e48e85864c01faccc280b26d77f25247a9",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bcb6e07204f0f1b1b77991fc814e9ebe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "重返赛场，也有新的难关。二零二五年，她与合作多年的教练分开，排名一度跌出世界前四百。后来，她开始和克莱门斯·瓦格纳合作。到秋天的广州，当时排名三百零五的她，从资格赛打到了四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c9017bd739d04c788eff1f66d14b7a7fb6e372853de2740fd0db8d760f6119f5",
      "words_sha256": "f8f578f9ae814c95f5921624d5333e1eeb1f9b75dcdb5c311bef61c19b303bc7",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cf3f2f5011bdac8312782dfeb88da47b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她也在写作。每天记日记，把赛前的焦虑和脑子里的想法一点点整理出来。她把自己的名字，和英文里清晰这个词，拼成了博客的标题。球场之外，她在学习怎样更好地理解自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6b2b33b335a1e53b423b65c6108423ffe5aafa94361030ba2198cfd65b15130e",
      "words_sha256": "e0624190684a19653e086cebe7f9c76ac6419ace60c146c3a96258ffddc75470",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1608fc4fd9f8e425ef3a3efeb8e508e2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年五月，在斯洛伐克的特尔纳瓦，她拿到两年来第一座单打冠军。那是一站ITF赛事。随后来到法网，她又从资格赛打起，走进正赛。排名、胜场、信心，都在一点点重新积累。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "eafb285c24d530ba034db91a1c7a541124034a6ea7895e2e60905fca1e688d7b",
      "words_sha256": "7542160cf9fbc84b110a70a690f6c49caed08a5cd9e7d7c99091139f321bea49",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "375c9d705376a4c0fc4fdf6721198328",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了温网，她连过资格赛，再打进生涯第一次大满贯第三轮。那天早上，她的酒店住宿到期，只能先退房；赢球后，又得重新找住处。男友提醒她：收拾行李，并不代表你就要离开比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9fa9e7f93bed4ec294f370ddb0699f787432d84687e20907bd960839db2a3e7e",
      "words_sha256": "e7a52ee8d90ac5cccd310f85026e18ca357ca6b6bf01a6836882762d06c6f617",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7a68247b81bd3b6c8895c0bd338ee504",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九年前，她在这里拿过同年龄组冠军；九年后，第一次站上成年组第三轮。她说，年轻时的自己，反而会比现在更相信这件事。她仍在学习把信心找回来，也学着接受：比赛的结果，无法完全由自己控制。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cf4160538e91279f45026a362f28192e68d561c8eb6df955d174d05e482e3d4a",
      "words_sha256": "592bc28634cd74b0c86e3f6e62dd7b0b3756aaf7664a75d36bee74edec02d871",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c4e3a2361217f4db3efe667295b07d58",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月，她又在巴兰基亚拿到一座WTA一百二十五级别冠军。所以，香港这次，准确地说，是巡回赛单打首冠。她已经拿过不少奖杯，这一座，却有不同的分量。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ca71a009c63b40ff4fc5af990862f982c11731c1843697d12ea923c773162308",
      "words_sha256": "43eba6d4f078503301c2269f627a32c142678c8e56afc6019988b59c1df1763a",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1bd460db02b56b2fc1b63c147a10af0d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一周前的广州，她止步八强。来到香港时，她的世界排名是一百零二。首轮击败普罗佐罗娃，第二轮战胜博尔特，再过森梅兹这一关。来到赛季末的这一站，她把胜利一场接一场留了下来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ed4cd10eae599202d8d8f05cb1c73854edc5cf8322fd03be9daa4031c165c5e7",
      "words_sha256": "78fd9941ebf487fb0e02814e493c7004ef5b28afcbce9f00f0cf11390991c814",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e25cdb411d2e8f10e5077e8309655a69",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛面对舒布拉泽，首盘打到五平，她随后连赢两局。第二盘六比四，时隔四年，她又一次打进巡回赛单打决赛。从二十一岁时的拉巴特，到二十六岁时的香港，终于有了第二次机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0002db186848b2092e864d8d6f3f48f6c03eb74907eff8bdda0da79479ff9181",
      "words_sha256": "ae5b1dc4f194a317fac7201bf7210c5e7495d9702b21b45345571ff0799f6f1d",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bbdcc85609ea7f8c8d3c3b1601b20353",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛的对手，是世界排名第十七的伊埃拉。首盘三比四落后时，伊埃拉叫了医疗暂停。比赛继续，她也坚持打到了最后。刘婧文拿下首盘六比三，第二盘又建立起领先。这一次，她要把自己的节奏，保持到比赛结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fac9c220fc646f77cc1f199874c560ca751154bb945e3b876331408b7f010969",
      "words_sha256": "478c76a74c883b119d545ad67b6e2539325b488fee91e55480e48803ccc92ef7",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3761002a05a9028426396e8d37c9c0e7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘五比零，刘婧文发球，四十比三十。这一次，距离巡回赛单打冠军，只差最后一分。十七岁赢温网的那个女孩，如今站在这里，二十六岁，准备再发一个球。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a6b6a528a98e1e244ec4f969a9f583e26c64b5deb41415ca5c11490b091073cd",
      "words_sha256": "dfdb1139f2e01e33ed42a03b104cf1018163022a34da8a2a795499711465f7c8",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "010d76416df44bb6568a0a0c1123e2fa",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五场胜利，一盘未失。刘婧文终于拿到巡回赛单打首冠。那个十七岁在温网赢球的女孩，经历过暂停，也经历过重新出发。今天，她亲吻了这只奖杯。这个故事里，你更佩服夺冠的那一分，还是那些把自己带回球场的日子？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c3e7caca2816a25910b0a1d05b559d9b5da06f8af410e7cdc05415fbcc6c83f1",
      "words_sha256": "6085c13b02265161d89b0c44fd5e52fe5cff97947c07a9a3b17f828a9eb35620",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5362f9244d7dc99f23c260fbd86e389f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "刘婧文等到二十六岁，巡回赛单打首冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d01422f286e7af5fcb3cad995867c7b55dc5ee16f6c86f3e3b83990789fd5f97",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
